<title>ZIMBABWE: FINANCIAL HOLDINGS PLANS RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>FINANCIAL HOLDINGS PLANS RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's Financial Holdings Ltd (Finhold) said on Thursday it planned to hold a rights issue to raise its share capital to Z$100 million from Z$26 million as part of a continuing restructuring programme.</p>
<p>It in a statement further details of the proposed issue would be published soon.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +(263-4) 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
